    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You can project your emotions into any creature's mind, conveying thought without language. When you cast a spell or use an action with the Auditory and Linguistic traits, you may replace the Auditory and Linguistic traits with the Mental trait. Diplomacy checks made in this way take a -2 circumstance penalty.</p>"
